    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "So Dmitry takes it upon himself to taste the dish. Next time you watch the episode, listen for the Russian expressions for 'to perform' and 'pleasant' — you will catch every word right away. See you in the next scene.",
      "gap": 0.5
